{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16580","headline":"南至日太史登台书云物 · 于尹躬","name":"南至日太史登台书云物","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"至日行时令，登台约礼文。\n官称伯赵氏，色辨五方云。\n昼漏听初发，阳光望渐分。\n司天爲岁备，持简出人羣。\n惠爱周微物，生灵荷圣君。\n长当有嘉瑞，郁郁复纷纷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"于尹躬","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16580.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16580","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}